+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a cache eviction policy. A search of the repository's documentation (`docs/doc.md`), changelog, and codebase found no ADR, policy document, or other recorded decision specifying an eviction strategy (e.g., LRU, LFU, TTL) for any cache used in the project; the only cache-related references are to per-request query/form parameter caching in `Context` and to TLS certificate caching in an autocert example, neither of which documents an eviction policy.
